  "definition": "Dam Management Plans",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-12-22",
  "historyNote": "#7901, eff 5-29-03 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1900) (formerly Env-Ws 1905.05); ss by #9936, eff 5-28-11; ss by #12695, eff 12-22-18 (formerly Env-Wq 1906.04)",
